# What must never enter the image.
#
# .env is the important one: an image is pushed to a registry, and a laptop's
# secrets must not ride along. A deployment gets its configuration from the
# platform's environment variables, never from a copied file.

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode

node_modules
dist

data
coverage
/[Rr]ef*
config/sender.local.json

.env
.env.*
*.log

eval/results
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
